      "song_duration_ms": 7262
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p02",
      "text": "A field is named for what fills it: a cornfield, a wheat field, an oilfield, a snowfield.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p02.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p02.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8620,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p02.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8097
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p03",
      "text": "The chief crop of the fields is grass. A field of grass feeds the cows.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p03.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p03.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6608,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p03.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7497
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p04",
      "text": "Every field has thieves. Bugs, birds, mice and deer steal a piece of the crop.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p04.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p04.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6922,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7810
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "A farmer shields the field with a net, a fence or a scarecrow. No shield stops a thief.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7836,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8829
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "A field is cut in pieces. Each piece gets its own crop, so one bug can not eat every piece.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8306,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8829
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "What a field gives back is its yield. A big yield fills the shed. A brief dry spell means grief.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 8724,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 10057
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "Science has lifted the yield: one field now grows what nine fields grew long ago.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7209,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8646
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "Not every field grows a crop. In an outfield, a fielder waits for a fly ball.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6765,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_089/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8150
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p10",
      "text": "In science, in the field means out of the lab. A reef can be a field, and every field has a thief!",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_089/pages/p10.webp",
